 the  emolument stuff the ways in which Donald  Trump has had four foreign diplomats and  others come and stay at his hotel in DC  to funnel money directly into his family  business and then the bigger ways in  which Donald Trump has funneled money  into his  pockets when he travels to his own clubs  and resorts when his campaign funnels  donor money right back into his pockets  by using donor money to rent out event  spaces and hire catering from Donald  Trump's own restaurants and hotels and  venues we've talked about it all before  Trump's participation in Yemen of via  Saudi Arabia as a proxy and that  completely immoral humanitarian crisis  there have been no consequences for  anything with impeachment of course now  being at the most recent of being the  most recent example with his acquittal  on both articles this week getting away  with everything  no witnesses in the impeachment trial a  prejudged conclusion in coordination  with Senate Majority Leader Mitch  McConnell Trump's personal lawyer is  running all over the world doing  so-called drug deals that's what Trump's  own former national security adviser  john bolton called them arranging  corruption he'd now is joking  increasingly about being president  longer than the Constitution would allow  and in fact I know that these are all  these are like 98 percent jokes two  percent serious when he does it posted  to Twitter a video yesterday which we're  now going to show our video audience  where there are signs flying by saying  Trump 2024 Trump 2028 etc I get it  big joke triggering the libs all that  stuff but if Donald Trump loses in  November of 2020  I don't expect a peaceful transition I  expect claims if it's a close election  I expect claims that it was rigged or  that the counting was wrong and that he  didn't really lose if it's a big margin  if we do the thing I'm saying we have to  do which is turnout in such overwhelming  numbers that we outdo the voter  suppression and the meddling and the  