e time the long journey to  authoritarianism also begins with a  single step and sometimes it moves so  slowly that you can't even notice we are  well down the authoritarian road at this  point in time when you compare where we  were before Donald Trump was inaugurated  to where we are today attacks on media  and suppression of journalists and  journalism that the White House doesn't  like it's just common it barely is a  blip on the radar at the  point-in-time trump regularly gleeful  and praising the authoritarian types  that many of us feel are the most  anti-american thing while criticizing  our Western historic democratic allies  it barely even makes headlines anymore  and in fact many trumpets agree they  like the Assad Hooton kim jong you know  whoever Duterte types and are glad and  agree with trump when it comes to his  criticisms of Emmanuel macron or Angela  Merkel or whoever by the way Angela  Merkel no bleeding heart liberal to  begin with so Trump is a symptom of many  underlying problems and not the cause  but he is an exacerbating symptom he is  a symptom that is making the problem  significantly worse he wants people to  believe that voter fraud is the reason  why he didn't win the popular vote in  2016 even though yes he won the  electoral college  imagine if he loses the election okay he  will do whatever he can to Kontest it he  will try to get it tied up in court if  he will succeed is anyone's guess I  maintain that if he loses he will  ultimately relinquish power but I don't  believe it's going to be peaceful let me  know what you think about this I want to  encourage everybody in my audience to go  subscribe to a YouTube channel we're  partnering with it's called up flip they  release new videos every week in every  video you meet a different entrepreneur  and get an in-depth look at how their  business works and how they became  successful it's great if you like shows  like Shark Tank if you own your own  business or you're thinking of starting  one the up flip YouTube channel really  does offer a wealth of knowledge and  inspiration as an entrepreneur myself  and a business owner I've really been  enjoying hearing all of the different  stories of the people that they  interview but it's really fascinating  content even if you don't own your own  business to go check out the up flip  youtube channel they're friends of the  David Pakman show I'd love it if you  would support them by subscribing to  their channel you can find the up flip  YouTube channel by going to david  pakman.com slash up flip you're watching  this on youtube i've put the  right underneath this video

